  itemId: block_advanced_distillation_tower
  displayName: Advanced Distillation Tower
  description: "The petroleum-era plant: a tall atmospheric distillation column that
    turns 100 L of crude into six typed product cuts \u2014 LPG, naphtha, kerosene,
    diesel, gasoline and heavy fuel oil \u2014 each held in its own tank, each with
    a coloured sight gauge on the tower and an analog dial in the panel. Only this
    block converts crude; the Oil Refinery keeps its legacy refined-oil recipes.
    Feeds one liquid at a time (crude for the Atmospheric Cut, refined oil for the
    Re-Run cut)."
